perfil_muestras.bin (threads with CPU per core, every presented frame with the renderer's GPU,
GPU-wait and recording totals, the stack samples) for tools/switch/perf_report.py; the renderer now
feeds the long-frame windows (RexSwitchPerfTiron, never called before).

